{"source_id":"W402","platform":"RSS","author":"AUTOMATON RSS","account_type":"メディア","text":"Steamの新たなデッキ構築ローグライク『Re:Night ― 終わらぬ夜』8月5日に前倒し発売へ。「無制限巻き戻し」で失敗し放題、火力はマシマシ戦略RPG\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260803-458164-header.jpg\" width=\"1920\" /></p>ハリソンワールドは、Seahorse Gamesが手がける『Re:Night ― 終わらぬ夜』を8月5日に発売予定だ。","url":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20260803-458164/","timestamp":"2026-08-03T11:37:19Z","extra":{"source_priority":"high","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W402","platform":"RSS","author":"AUTOMATON RSS","account_type":"メディア","text":"因習村生活シム『ほの暮しの庭』、発売から4日で売上10万本突破。「パッケージ版が一部で品切れ」する勢い\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260803-458158-header.jpg\" width=\"1600\" /></p>日本一ソフトウェアは8月3日、『ほの暮しの庭』の国内累計販売本数10万本突破を報告した。","url":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20260803-458158/","timestamp":"2026-08-03T09:16:07Z","extra":{"source_priority":"high","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
